#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2018
msgid "<p>Click on <i>Finish</i> for putting UCS into operation.</p>"
msgstr "<p>按一下 <i>完成</i> 即可讓 UCS 開始運作。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2009
msgid "<p>Click on <i>Finish</i> for putting this system into operation.</p>"
msgstr "<p>按一下 <i>完成</i> 即可讓本系統開始運作。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2007
msgid "<p>Click on <i>Finish</i> to conclude the installation. The system will be prepared for the first boot procedure and will be rebooted afterwards.</p>"
msgstr "<p>按一下 <i>完成</i> 以結束安裝。系統將為首次開機程序進行準備，之後會重新啟動。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:952
msgid "<p>Enter the name of your organization and an e-mail address to activate UCS.</p>"
msgstr "<p>輸入您的組織名稱及一組電子郵件位址以啟用 UCS。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:309
#, javascript-format
msgid "<p>Enter the name of your organization, an e-mail address to activate %s Appliance and a password for your <i>Administrator</i> account.</p><p>The password is mandatory, it will be used for the domain Administrator as well as for the local superuser <i>root</i>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>輸入您的組織名稱、一組用於啟用 %s Appliance 的電子郵件位址，以及您 <i>Administrator</i> 帳號的密碼。</p><p>此密碼為必填，將同時用於網域 Administrator 以及本機超級使用者 <i>root</i>。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:299
msgid "<p>Enter the name of your organization, an e-mail address to activate UCS and a password for your <i>Administrator</i> account.</p><p>The password is mandatory, it will be used for the domain Administrator as well as for the local superuser <i>root</i>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>輸入您的組織名稱、一組用於啟用 UCS 的電子郵件位址，以及您 <i>Administrator</i> 帳號的密碼。</p><p>此密碼為必填，將同時用於網域 Administrator 以及本機超級使用者 <i>root</i>。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2639
#, javascript-format
msgid "<p>One or more network interfaces could not obtain an IP address via DHCP. These interfaces will use automatic generated private addresses instead (APIPA).</p> <ul> %s </ul> <p>Please adjust your DHCP settings or confirm use of private address(es).</p>"
msgstr "<p>有一個或多個網路介面無法透過 DHCP 取得 IP 位址。這些介面將改用自動產生的私人位址 ( APIPA )。</p> <ul> %s </ul> <p>請調整您的 DHCP 設定，或確認使用私人位址。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:827
msgid "<p>Select UCS software components for installation on this system. This step can be skipped; the components are also available in the Univention App Center in the category <i>UCS components</i>.</p><p>Third-party software (e.g., groupware) is also available through the Univention App Center.</p>"
msgstr "<p>選擇要安裝至本系統的 UCS 軟體元件。此步驟可略過；這些元件在 Univention App Center 的 <i>UCS components</i> 分類中也可取得。</p><p>第三方軟體 ( 例如群組軟體 ) 同樣可透過 Univention App Center 取得。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2964
#, javascript-format
msgid "<p>The hostname <i>%s</i> is longer than 15 characters.</p><p>It will not be possible to install an Active Directory compatible Domaincontroller (Samba 4) or UCS@school. The hostname cannot be changed after the installation of %s. It is recommended to shorten the hostname to maximal 15 characters.</p>"
msgstr "<p>主機名稱 <i>%s</i> 超過 15 個字元。</p><p>將無法安裝與 Active Directory 相容的 Domaincontroller ( Samba 4 ) 或 UCS@school。主機名稱在 %s 安裝完成後即無法變更。建議將主機名稱縮短至最多 15 個字元。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2014
msgid "<p>When accessing the system for the first time, you will be asked to request and upload a new license.</p>"
msgstr "<p>首次存取本系統時，將要求您索取並上傳新的授權。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2012
msgid "<p>When accessing the system for the first time, you will be asked to upload a new license that has been sent to your email account.</p>"
msgstr "<p>首次存取本系統時，將要求您上傳已寄送至您電子郵件帳號的新授權。</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2647
msgid "<p>With the current settings <b> no </b> internet access is available.</p><p>Because of this some functions like the App Center or software-updates will not be accessible</p>"
msgstr "<p>以目前的設定 <b> 無法 </b> 連上網際網路。</p><p>因此 App Center 或軟體更新等部分功能將無法使用</p>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1549
#, javascript-format
msgid "<tr><td>City:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"
msgstr "<tr><td>城市:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1569
#, javascript-format
msgid "<tr><td>Default locale:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"
msgstr "<tr><td>預設地區設定:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1598
#, javascript-format
msgid "<tr><td>Keyboard layout:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"
msgstr "<tr><td>鍵盤配置:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1552
#, javascript-format
msgid "<tr><td>Timezone:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"
msgstr "<tr><td>時區:</td><td>%s</td></tr>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:608
msgid "A Backup Directory Node is the fallback system for the UCS Primary Directory Node and can take over the role of the Primary Directory Node permanently. It is recommended to use at least one Backup Directory Node in the domain."
msgstr "備份目錄節點是 UCS 主要目錄節點的備援系統，並可永久接管主要目錄節點的角色。建議在網域中至少使用一個備份目錄節點。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:311
msgid "A few questions are needed to complete the configuration process."
msgstr "需要回答幾個問題以完成設定程序。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1752
msgid "A new UCS domain will be created."
msgstr "將建立一個新的 UCS 網域。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:307
msgid "A new domain directory is created on this system. User and management data are stored locally."
msgstr "本系統將建立一個新的網域目錄。使用者與管理資料儲存於本機。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1754
msgid "A preconfigured test domain will be instantiated."
msgstr "將執行個體化一個預先設定的測試網域。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2820
msgid "A previous UCS system has already joined into the Active Directory domain. Please make sure the system \"%(ucs_master_fqdn)s\" is reachable via SSH. If you continue with \"Replace system\" the registration of the previous UCS system will be removed."
msgstr "先前的 UCS 系統已加入 Active Directory 網域。請確認系統 \"%(ucs_master_fqdn)s\" 可透過 SSH 連線。若您以「取代系統」繼續，先前 UCS 系統的註冊將被移除。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1116
msgid "A proxy address needs to be specified in the format: <i>http://proxy.mydomain.intranet:3128</i><br/>Proxy access with username and password may be specified via the format: <i>http://username:password@proxy.mydomain.intranet:3128</i>"
msgstr "Proxy 位址需以下列格式指定: <i>http://proxy.mydomain.intranet:3128</i><br/>使用使用者名稱與密碼的 Proxy 存取可透過下列格式指定: <i>http://username:password@proxy.mydomain.intranet:3128</i>"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1109
msgid "A valid e-mail address allows to activate the UCS system for using the Univention App Center. The address can be specified now or also at a later point in time. An e-mail with a personalized license key will then be sent to your e-mail address. This license can be uploaded via the license dialog in Univention Management Console."
msgstr "有效的電子郵件位址可啟用 UCS 系統以使用 Univention App Center。此位址可現在指定，也可稍後再指定。屆時將寄送一封含有個人化授權金鑰的電子郵件至您的電子郵件位址。此授權可透過 Univention Management Console 中的授權對話方塊上傳。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1107
#, javascript-format
msgid "A valid e-mail address is required to activate %s Appliance. The address can be specified now or also at a later point in time. An e-mail with a personalized license key will then be sent to your e-mail address. This license can be uploaded after the setup process."
msgstr "啟用 %s Appliance 需要有效的電子郵件位址。此位址可現在指定，也可稍後再指定。屆時將寄送一封含有個人化授權金鑰的電子郵件至您的電子郵件位址。此授權可於設定程序完成後上傳。"

