msgstr "設定系統"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:297
msgid "Configure this system as first system for the new domain. Additional systems can join the domain later."
msgstr "將本系統設定為新網域的第一個系統。其他系統可於稍後加入該網域。"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:839
msgid "Confirm configuration settings"
msgstr "確認組態設定"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1934
msgid "Connect to Univention Management Console on this system either as user <b>Administrator</b> or as user <b>root</b> in case the system has not yet created a new UCS domain:"
msgstr "以使用者 <b>Administrator</b> 或使用者 <b>root</b> ( 若系統尚未建立新的 UCS 網域 ) 連線至本系統上的 Univention Management Console:"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1942
msgid "Connect to Univention Management Console on this system either as user <b>Administrator</b> or as user <b>root</b> in case the system has not yet joined the domain:"
msgstr "以使用者 <b>Administrator</b> 或使用者 <b>root</b> ( 若系統尚未加入網域 ) 連線至本系統上的 Univention Management Console:"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2970 usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2994
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2644
msgid "Continue with 169.254.*.* addresse(s)"
msgstr "使用 169.254.*.* 位址繼續"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:1669
msgid "Continue with duplicate hostname"
msgstr "使用重複的主機名稱繼續"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2810
msgid "Continue with incomplete settings"
msgstr "使用不完整的設定繼續"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2699
msgid "Continue without access to the repository servers"
msgstr "在無法存取軟體庫伺服器的情況下繼續"

#: usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2650 usr/share/univention-system-setup/www/ApplianceWizard.js:2672
